  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the LGBT Community by Fostering a Greater Sense of Community</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Belize, it is often difficult for marginalized persons, including those with non-traditional gender identities or sexual orientations, to access the services they need and more fully participate in their local communities and economies. The IAF supports community-led approaches to promoting civic participation and creating inclusive societies in Latin America and the Caribbean. Our grantee partner, Our Circle (OC), manages the first full-service Resource Center in Belize, where marginalized communities can safely access counseling, services, education, and networking opportunities and raise awareness of their rights among their peers and the general public.</narrative>
  </description>
